-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/postcss-import" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">postcss-import</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832="">Michael Ciniawky<a href="https://opencollective.com/postcss/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-link" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/postcss-load-config" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">postcss-load-config</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832="">motdotla<a href="https://dotenvx.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-link" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/dotenv-expand" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">dotenv-expand</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832="">Rich Harris</td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href={"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@rollup/pluginutils"} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">&#64;rollup/pluginutils</code></a></span>{", "}<span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/estree-walker" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">estree-walker</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/sapphi-red" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">sapphi-red</a><a href="https://github.com/sponsors/sapphi-red" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-link" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/artichokie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">artichokie</code></a></span>{", "}<span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/fresh-import" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">fresh-import</code></a></span>{", "}<span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/host-validation-middleware" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">host-validation-middleware</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://sindresorhus.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Sindre Sorhus</a><a href="https://github.com/sponsors/sindresorhus" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-link" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/open" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">open</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="http://thlorenz.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Thorsten Lorenz</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/convert-source-map" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">convert-source-map</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="http://tjholowaychuk.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">TJ Holowaychuk</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/connect" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">connect</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/troygoode/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Troy Goode</a><a href="https://opencollective.com/express" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-link" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/cors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">cors</code></a></span></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832="">William Stein</td><td data-v-46700832=""><span class="pkg-item" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/http-proxy-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">http-proxy-3</code></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="tip custom-block" data-v-46700832=""><p class="custom-block-title" data-v-46700832="">For package authors</p><p data-v-46700832="">{"This section is automatically generated from the "}<code data-v-46700832="">author</code>{" and "}<code data-v-46700832="">funding</code>{" fields in each package's "}<code data-v-46700832="">package.json</code>. If you'd like to update how your package appears here, you can update these fields in your package.</p></div><h2 id="development-tools" tabindex="-1" data-v-46700832="">{"Development Tools "}<a class="header-anchor" href="#development-tools" aria-label="Permalink to “Development Tools”" data-v-46700832="">{"​"}</a></h2><p data-v-46700832="">Vite's development workflow is powered by these tools:</p><div class="deps-list notable" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-item" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-header" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/oxfmt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">oxfmt</code></a><span class="dep-links" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a><a href="https://github.com/sponsors/oxc-project" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link sponsor" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></span></div><p class="dep-author" data-v-46700832="">{" by "}Boshen and oxc contributors</p><p data-v-46700832="">Formatter for the JavaScript Oxidation Compiler</p></div><div class="dep-item" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-header" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/oxlint" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">oxlint</code></a><span class="dep-links" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a><a href="https://github.com/sponsors/oxc-project" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link sponsor" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></span></div><p class="dep-author" data-v-46700832="">{" by "}Boshen and oxc contributors</p><p data-v-46700832="">Linter for the JavaScript Oxidation Compiler</p></div><div class="dep-item" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-header" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/playwright-chromium" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">playwright-chromium</code></a><span class="dep-links" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/microsoft/playwright" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></span></div><p class="dep-author" data-v-46700832="">{" by "}Microsoft Corporation</p><p data-v-46700832="">A high-level API to automate Chromium</p></div><div class="dep-item" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-header" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">typescript</code></a><span class="dep-links" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></span></div><p class="dep-author" data-v-46700832="">{" by "}Microsoft Corp.</p><p data-v-46700832="">TypeScript is a language for application scale JavaScript development</p></div><div class="dep-item" data-v-46700832=""><div class="dep-header" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/vitest" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">vitest</code></a><span class="dep-links" data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a><a href="https://opencollective.com/vitest" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="dep-link sponsor" data-v-46700832="">Sponsor</a></span></div><p class="dep-author" data-v-46700832="">{" by "}Anthony Fu</p><p data-v-46700832="">Next generation testing framework powered by Vite</p></div></div><h2 id="past-notable-dependencies" tabindex="-1" data-v-46700832="">{"Past Notable Dependencies "}<a class="header-anchor" href="#past-notable-dependencies" aria-label="Permalink to “Past Notable Dependencies”" data-v-46700832="">{"​"}</a></h2><p data-v-46700832="">We also thank the maintainers of these projects that Vite used in previous versions:</p><table data-v-46700832=""><thead data-v-46700832=""><tr data-v-46700832=""><th data-v-46700832="">Package</th><th data-v-46700832="">Description</th><th data-v-46700832="">Links</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-46700832=""><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/esbuild" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">esbuild</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">JavaScript/TypeScript bundler and minifier (now using Rolldown, Oxc, and LightningCSS)</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/evanw/esbuild" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/rollup" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">rollup</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">ES module bundler (now using Rolldown)</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/rollup/rollup" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/http-proxy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">http-proxy</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">HTTP proxying (now using http-proxy-3)</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/http-party/node-http-proxy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/acorn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">acorn</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">JavaScript parser</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/acornjs/acorn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/fast-glob" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">fast-glob</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">Fast glob matching (now using tinyglobby/fdir)</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/mrmlnc/fast-glob" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr><tr data-v-46700832=""><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/debug" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832=""><code data-v-46700832="">debug</code></a></td><td data-v-46700832="">Debug logging (now using obug)</td><td data-v-46700832=""><a href="https://github.com/debug-js/debug" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-46700832="">Repo</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></main><footer class="VPDocFooter" data-v-94d54df8="" data-v-56f0051a=""><div class="edit-info" data-v-56f0051a=""><div class="edit-link" data-v-56f0051a=""><a class="VPLink link vp-external-link-icon no-icon edit-link-button" href="https://github.com/vitejs/vite/edit/main/docs/acknowledgements.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-56f0051a=""><span class